# the normal ClusterIP service returns ONE virtual IP for the same pods:

$ kubectl -n svc-lab exec curl-box -- nslookup web-clusterip.svc-lab.svc.cluster.local
Server:		10.96.0.10
Address:	10.96.0.10:53


